{"id":"9e920083cdf9b067","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-ultrafilter.md","title":"Ultrafilter","display":"df-ultrafilter — Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-ultrafilter","aliases":["17-df-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-ultrafilter — Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[17-df-filter]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; bridge and principal characterization locally checked; local empty-index extension","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"ultrafilter definition; Exercise 4.1.4","source_pages_print":[213,223],"source_pages_djvu":[229,239],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.1.2","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrafilter — Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; bridge and principal characterization locally checked; local empty-index extension"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"ultrafilter definition; Exercise 4.1.4"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>213</span><span>223</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span><span>239</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.1.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为候选集合族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Filter}_I\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\)</span> 在本条作为本册超滤子的二元别名定义。以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Principal}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Principal}_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I\\)</span>，也对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(U)\\land\n\\forall X\\subseteq I\\;(X\\in U\\leftrightarrow I\\setminus X\\notin U),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Principal}_I(U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\n\\exists i_0\\in I\\;(U=\\{X\\subseteq I:i_0\\in X\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I(U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Principal}_I(U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(U)\\land\n\\forall X\\subseteq I\\;(X\\in U\\leftrightarrow I\\setminus X\\notin U),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Principal}_I(U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\n\\exists i_0\\in I\\;(U=\\{X\\subseteq I:i_0\\in X\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I(U)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Principal}_I(U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书在非空指标集上讨论。本地延伸到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时，补集二择一式不能成立，所以没有超滤子、主超滤子或非主超滤子；外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> 接口也为假。没有引入空指标超积。</p>\n<p>超滤子的定义与原书印刷 p.213（DjVu 229）逐项对应；主超滤子的表示来自习题4.1.4，印刷 p.223（DjVu 239），该习题没有给证明。桥接可直接证明：二择一式和真性等价于“恰取集合或其补集之一”；空集不在超滤子中。主超滤子的单点表示与非主补谓词均已闭合。主性表示的论证是：极大真滤子若由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 主生成，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 有两个不同元素，则把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 切成非空的两部分与二择一性矛盾，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 为单点。这里没有声称核验全章后续习题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 是任意集合，$U$ 为候选集合族。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 与 $\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)$ 在本条作为本册超滤子的二元别名定义。以下定义 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$、$\\operatorname{Principal}_I$、$\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I$，也对 $I=\\varnothing$ 定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Principal}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(U)\\land\n\\forall X\\subseteq I\\;(X\\in U\\leftrightarrow I\\setminus X\\notin U),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Principal}_I(U)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\n\\exists i_0\\in I\\;(U=\\{X\\subseteq I:i_0\\in X\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I(U)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Principal}_I(U).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":2421,"backlinks":[{"id":"b2fa45baaddb4aa3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"8da8d19dd38c73b2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"37ec92ca6163508a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$V$ (ultrafilter on $J$, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"53c6cdb1648dd0a3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是任意集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]，包括其中明确的空指标本地扩展。以下定义集合 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)$。"},{"id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$I$ 是非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超积谓词及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}$ 是 $i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 的常值族。以下定义四元谓词 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$。"},{"id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 是同一语言 $L$ 的结构族，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子，谓词见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$、$P$、$\\sim_D$、$[f]_D$ 与 $P/{\\sim_D}$ 见 [[17-df-reduced-product]]；在本节点以 $D=U$ 实例化这些记号，$f\\in P$ 时使用 $[f]_U$。元理论及选择公理假设继承该构造。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构，以下定义 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L$。"},{"id":"97a5b6dd9bfa3001","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"2b5fa486b2ca4645","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"dfe6cf29ee360a19","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作，见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为 $L$-结构族，$U$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)$；其乘积载体 $P$ 和商类 $[f]_U$ 见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 为自由变量包含于 $\\{v_j:j<n\\}$ 的公式集，见 [[17-df-type]]；元组满足记号见 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]。$\\bar f\\in P^n$ 为代表元的有限元组。"},{"id":"76b41a152803a0c7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 中工作，选择公理见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$。$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。"},{"id":"14765bedc096a21d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在超积构造所用的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$I$ 为非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超幂谓词与初等嵌入集合分别见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]、[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]。自然映射的构造和初等性见 [[17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding]]。"},{"id":"337f8d2b9e4a90b7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17